    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "healing? how can you reclaim something that doesn't exist anymore? the version of me that people actually cared about is gone. the person standing here now is just a shadow. it feels like i'm just haunting my own life. there's no path back from this kind of shame. it's just... over.",
