      "content": "it's not just \"pain\" though. it's the finality of it. people don't just \"build new selves\" after their entire reputation is incinerated. they just look at you with pity or disgust. there is no \"new self\" that can live with this. staying in this world just feels like a slow, humiliating punishment for mistakes that have already destroyed everything. it's like i'm just waiting for the credits to roll so i can finally stop pretending.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
